<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 19.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 19.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Monday, May 19:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,552.10 (1,511.40)	CHF  1,085.40 (1,059.40)</p>
<p>    DEM    912.14 (894.53)	  GBP  2,545.30 (2,481.60)</p>
<p>    ATS    129.61 (127.06)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Friday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $17.98 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$16.52 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $34.50 million ($30.06 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
